= The Tenth Congress and the New Economic Policy

In March 1921, the Tenth Congress of the Russian Communist Party ended War Communism. The grain requisition was replaced by a fixed tax in kind; peasants may sell the surplus on a market; small private trade and small industry are permitted. At the same Congress, on Lenin's motion, factions were banned inside the party.

It is a retreat in the economy, and an advance in the politics: a revolution that gives the market to the peasant and keeps the monopoly of power for itself.

[? if nep_early = 1 : The Mensheviks' programme of 1919 had been listened to, in part, two years earlier. The policy that is now called the NEP has been in practice in some provinces since then. ?]

- @claim: Claim the NEP as our own programme.
- @sr_claim: Say that the NEP is the peasants' victory.
- @demand: Demand political freedom to match.

@claim
view-if: player_party = 'menshevik'
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 3, peasants: 3, middle: 4});
RO.add(Q, {bread: 4, rel_bol: -2});
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 2, -2);
if (Q.program_adopted) { RO.boost(Q, {workers: 2, middle: 2}); Q.soviet_democracy += 2; }
!}

We said that the NEP was our programme, and that the Bolsheviks had taken it from our pamphlet of 1919. It is, within a few details, true. It is also what the Bolsheviks wished to hear least.

@demand
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 2, repression: 6, rel_bol: -4});
RO.boost(Q, {workers: 4, middle: 3, peasants: 2});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 1, -3);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 2);
if (Q.repression >= 30 && Q.legality > 1) { Q.legality -= 1; }
!}

We said that a market without freedom was half a policy. The Bolsheviks, who agree that it is half a policy, regard the other half as a luxury.

@sr_claim
view-if: player_party = 'sr'
on-arrival: {!
RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 4, middle: 3, workers: 1});
RO.add(Q, {bread: 4, rel_bol: -2});
if (Q.peasant_organised >= 2) { RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 3}); Q.soviet_democracy += 2; }
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 3);
!}

We said that the peasants' revolts and the party's peasant congresses had forced the Bolsheviks to give way, and that the tax in kind and the market were the first fruit of the land programme of 1917. The villages agree. The Bolsheviks do not like to be reminded.
